Subject: Restore original frontend quad providers and native packet ABI
Upstream-base: bab83befb5d6a2fdff0b30d2ec4b59f7251a108d

Restore all reconstructed GLDraw3 methods beneath the unchanged original
frontend decisions. Retain legacy validation only in explicitly diagnostic
consumers. Carry original view/matrix addresses at the host pointer width;
keep every numeric view/layer value and serialized Wii32 record unchanged.
Write the original display-list command geometry in Wii byte order and use
actual native stream fields. Preserve the source model field stores and exact
four-byte material array words. Full original finalizer/material providers
remain required; this does not establish game main, image readiness or GPU.

